Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 14:32:15 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: mfd: qcom,spmi-pmic: Add PM6450
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

PM6450 is the companion PMIC on SM6450 boards. It carries a temperature
alarm, nine GPIOs and a PWM block, and sits at SPMI SID 1.

Signed-off-by: Bruno Gregório <accounts@bruno.pw>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mfd/qcom,spmi-pmic.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mfd/qcom,spmi-pmic.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mfd/qcom,spmi-pmic.yaml
index 078a6886f..8bfe9b44f 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mfd/qcom,spmi-pmic.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mfd/qcom,spmi-pmic.yaml
@@ -38,6 +38,7 @@ properties:
           - qcom,pm6150
           - qcom,pm6150l
           - qcom,pm6350
+          - qcom,pm6450
           - qcom,pm660
           - qcom,pm660l
           - qcom,pm7250b
